      "id": 1,
      "text": "Mooresville earned its name when pioneer John Franklin Moore donated land for the railroad station, cementing his legacy as the town’s founding father.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
