      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Moore built the first brick factory in Mooresville and erected several early brick buildings on Main Street, shaping the town’s historic downtown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mooresville%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A public library opened in Mooresville in 1899, and by 1939 the library moved to a neo‑classical building on the former home of a local philanthropist.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
